    "proximate_text": "The probable cause of the failure of the fast bus transfer to initiate, was found to be surface debris and contaminants on the fast bus transfer auto/manual selector switch. This resulted in high and erratic resistance across the switch, preventing the actuation of a fast bus transfer from the unit auxiliary transformer to the start-up transformer.",
